 "annotations": [
  "agent summary: Independent day-220 assays disagree with the fitted model by 3.8876 sd for TAN, 7.0233 sd for titrimetric VFA, and 5.7303 sd for digestate VS (calls 12, 14, 15), a coherent indication that the declared influent mapping/loading is wrong rather than a kinetic change. Separately, gas-flow residuals show a 6.7459-sd step at day 229 with no significant load/feed structure (call 11), so post-step gas flow is quarantined as a sensor fault; the K_I_nh3 fit reaching 0.2 with a full-bound interval (call 9) is not offered as a plant parameter.",
